{"4109600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Requisition VR: Hunt & Extract", "steam_appid": 4109600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse yourself in a heart-pounding VR-exclusive PvPvE adventure. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources and unleash your creativity with a unique crafting system that lets you tape together nearly almost any objects you find, turning trash into devastating tools of destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team up with friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore massive open environments and battle through hordes of zombies and hostile players.<br> Every raid is a high-stakes mission, so get ready to extract your loot or lose it all. Upgrade your hideout, enhance your weapons and build the ultimate loadout to dominate the wasteland. The challenge awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative crafting mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine almost any items you come across in the environment to create improvised weapons on the go.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/f2b64f3afc779020eb8f36b9a3a3ad7b.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/f2b64f3afc779020eb8f36b9a3a3ad7b.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/f2b64f3afc779020eb8f36b9a3a3ad7b.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic environmental traps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across large open-world locations, traps can be triggered accidentally or strategically to attract zombie hordes — use them wisely or risk being overwhelmed.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e36c310a733abe01a27d5ae97b20b486.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e36c310a733abe01a27d5ae97b20b486.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e36c310a733abe01a27d5ae97b20b486.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barricades and locks vary from raid to raid, forcing players to find creative ways to enter houses with boarded-up windows or sealed doors. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/fcb9649d2bb776c5cfa9340dc558e3ca.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/fcb9649d2bb776c5cfa9340dc558e3ca.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/fcb9649d2bb776c5cfa9340dc558e3ca.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse enemy types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face zombies with distinct behaviors and resistances. Armored zombies shrug off bullets, while spiked zombies are best taken down from a distance to avoid brutal close combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e5e4d90a6894116e91d7ff3b27209064.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e5e4d90a6894116e91d7ff3b27209064.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e5e4d90a6894116e91d7ff3b27209064.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse yourself in a heart-pounding VR-exclusive PvPvE adventure. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources and unleash your creativity with a unique crafting system that lets you tape together nearly almost any objects you find, turning trash into devastating tools of destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team up with friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore massive open environments and battle through hordes of zombies and hostile players.<br> Every raid is a high-stakes mission, so get ready to extract your loot or lose it all. Upgrade your hideout, enhance your weapons and build the ultimate loadout to dominate the wasteland. The challenge awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative crafting mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine almost any items you come across in the environment to create improvised weapons on the go.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/f2b64f3afc779020eb8f36b9a3a3ad7b.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/f2b64f3afc779020eb8f36b9a3a3ad7b.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/f2b64f3afc779020eb8f36b9a3a3ad7b.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic environmental traps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across large open-world locations, traps can be triggered accidentally or strategically to attract zombie hordes — use them wisely or risk being overwhelmed.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e36c310a733abe01a27d5ae97b20b486.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e36c310a733abe01a27d5ae97b20b486.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e36c310a733abe01a27d5ae97b20b486.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barricades and locks vary from raid to raid, forcing players to find creative ways to enter houses with boarded-up windows or sealed doors. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/fcb9649d2bb776c5cfa9340dc558e3ca.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/fcb9649d2bb776c5cfa9340dc558e3ca.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/fcb9649d2bb776c5cfa9340dc558e3ca.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse enemy types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face zombies with distinct behaviors and resistances. Armored zombies shrug off bullets, while spiked zombies are best taken down from a distance to avoid brutal close combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e5e4d90a6894116e91d7ff3b27209064.poster.avif?t=1762971541\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e5e4d90a6894116e91d7ff3b27209064.webm?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/extras/e5e4d90a6894116e91d7ff3b27209064.mp4?t=1762971541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Experience an intense multiplayer PvPvE extraction shooter set in a vast post-apocalyptic world. Scavenge, duct-tape random objects into deadly weapons, fight both players and AI enemies, extract valuable loot, upgrade your base and return stronger each raid.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/f1df4fc65e87c2b0ef1c0f51c0f35ee4728aaf54/header.jpg?t=1762971541", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/ab76c2d83b5e5b25acaced51eca1f6c9eeb8675c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762971541", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109600/ab76c2d83b5e5b25acaced51eca1f6c9eeb8675c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762971541", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pr